1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,700
Cloudflare just opensource an AI skill

2
00:00:01,700 --> 00:00:03,700
that finds security holes in your vibe-coded app

3
00:00:03,700 --> 00:00:04,839
and it's completely free.

4
00:00:04,980 --> 00:00:06,200
They originally built it for themselves

5
00:00:06,200 --> 00:00:08,419
when it found over 7,000 security issues

6
00:00:08,419 --> 00:00:09,240
in their own code base

7
00:00:09,240 --> 00:00:11,439
and has already crossed 20,000 stars on GitHub.

8
00:00:11,660 --> 00:00:12,980
Just install it into your cloud code

9
00:00:12,980 --> 00:00:14,560
and it'll map out your entire app.

10
00:00:14,679 --> 00:00:16,879
Then it'll send a team of AI agents to hunt through it

11
00:00:16,879 --> 00:00:18,679
from your logins, database, and APIs,

12
00:00:18,839 --> 00:00:21,260
even prompt injection if your app uses AI under the hood.

13
00:00:21,379 --> 00:00:22,460
And then every bug they find

14
00:00:22,460 --> 00:00:23,920
is handed over to a separate agent

15
00:00:23,920 --> 00:00:26,399
whose only job is to disprove that bug exists.

16
00:00:26,620 --> 00:00:28,079
So only the real issues will make it

17
00:00:28,079 --> 00:00:28,960
all the way to the finish line.

18
00:00:28,960 --> 00:00:30,559
And finally, it'll give you a detailed report

19
00:00:30,559 --> 00:00:31,899
with every verified issue,

20
00:00:32,079 --> 00:00:33,259
along with exactly how to fix it.

21
00:00:33,320 --> 00:00:34,240
So if you want this for yourselves,

22
00:00:34,439 --> 00:00:35,799
just comment audit down below

23
00:00:35,799 --> 00:00:36,899
and it'll DM you the link directly.
